{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d2_doc0071","fact_refs":[0],"question":"What examination does the paper use as the basis for its machine listening comprehension task?","answer":"The TOEFL listening comprehension test, a challenging academic English exam for learners whose native language is not English."}
